## 2. HLD vs LLD

| Aspect | HLD | LLD |
|--------|-----|-----|
| **Scope** | System-wide architecture | Module/class level |
| **Audience** | Architects, managers, stakeholders | Developers |
| **Detail Level** | Abstract, high-level | Concrete, code-level |
| **Focus** | Components, data flow, tech stack | Classes, methods, algorithms |
| **Diagrams** | Block diagrams, deployment diagrams | Class diagrams, sequence diagrams |
| **Example** | "User service talks to DB via cache" | "UserService class has getUserById() method" |
| **When** | Before implementation begins | After HLD is approved |

