[Client] → [Cache Client Library]
                 │
          [Consistent Hashing]
                 │
    ┌────────────┼────────────┐
    ↓            ↓            ↓
[Cache Node1] [Cache Node2] [Cache Node3]
(Redis)       (Redis)       (Redis)
```

**Key Design Decisions:**
- **Partitioning**: Consistent hashing to distribute keys
- **Replication**: Primary-replica for high availability
- **Eviction**: LRU (most common)
- **Serialization**: Protobuf or MessagePack (faster than JSON)
- **Connection pooling**: Reuse connections to cache nodes
- **Hot keys**: Local cache (L1) in application for extremely hot keys

